KEENDRMS.ZIP  Commander Keen in Keen Dreams v1.13 - shareware (Softdisk/id, 1992)
 | Keen is in his pajamas and in trouble: King Boobus Tuber and his
 | army of killer vegetables have dragged him into a nightmare land of
 | tater troopers, carrot couriers and broccolash.  Flower power pellets
 | are your only weapon - turn them all into daisies!  The "lost" Keen
 | episode id Software made for Softdisk's Gamer's Edge.  EGA, 16 colours.
 | Needs an ARM PC: C:\GAMES\KEEN\GETKEEN.BAT fetches and installs it.
 | Distributed UNMODIFIED under Softdisk's BBS SysOp terms (LICENSE.DOC).
